# The software DOI goes here once the Zenodo record is minted, as
#
#   identifiers:
#     - type: doi
#       value: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXXX"
#       description: The archived snapshot of this repository.
#
# It is commented out rather than left as a placeholder because an invalid DOI breaks
# GitHub's "Cite this repository" panel and every CFF validator. DOI-PENDING-SOFTWARE
# is the token `release/make_release.py` greps for, so the build keeps saying so.

